  "description": "KADPUE crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C71 H85 N12 O30 Tb5,3(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.626-3.903 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.48-116.09°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C74H97N12O33Tb5.",
